<title>CHINA: S&amp;P assigned A- rating to Cheung Kong.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigned A- rating to Cheung Kong.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said on Wednesday it had assigned an A- long-term corporate credit rating to Cheung Kong Infrastructure Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>It said the company had a conservative financial profile, benefited from implicit support from strong parent companies, and had experienced management.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
